            "subheading": "#3",
            "title": "Sampling process",
            "content": "<p>Before final production, we offer a meticulous sampling process. You can approve the design, texture, and colors, making certain that every element perfectly reflects the rug you envisioned. This ensures the final piece is exactly as imagined.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
